			<formula GUID="_dd78f311-3922-48ff-aaa0-183bbb85484b" eId="preamble__enactingWords" name="enactingText">
				<p>The Secretary of State makes these <ref class="placeholder" href="#varDocSubType"/> in exercise of the power conferred by section 79(2) of the Product Security and Telecommunications Infrastructure Act 2022<authorialNote GUID="_93b40003-2e29-4add-af65-b788a922b354" class="footnote" eId="fnote_1" marker="1">
						<p>2022 c. 46.</p>
					</authorialNote>.</p>
			</formula>
